== book
  distributivity: (x ⊞ y) >>= k  (A B C)
  distributivity: (x >>= k) ⊞ (y >>= k)  (C B A)
  associativity: (p >>= f) >>= k  (A B C)
  associativity: p >>= (λi. f i >>= k)  (C B A)
== shift
  distributivity: (x ⊞ y) >>= k  (A B C)
  distributivity: (x >>= k) ⊞ (y >>= k)  (C B A)
  associativity: (p >>= f) >>= k  (A B C)
  associativity: p >>= (λi. f i >>= k)  (C B A)
== graded
  distributivity: (x ⊞ y) >>= k  (B C A)
  distributivity: (x >>= k) ⊞ (y >>= k)  (B C A)
  associativity: (p >>= f) >>= k  (B C A)
  associativity: p >>= (λi. f i >>= k)  (B C A)
== base
  distributivity: (x ⊞ y) >>= k  (B C A)
  distributivity: (x >>= k) ⊞ (y >>= k)  (B C A)
  associativity: (p >>= f) >>= k  (B C A)
  associativity: p >>= (λi. f i >>= k)  (B C A)
